om/flex022/uploads/ros/optimized/3X/6/b/6bec8e8c992ff72cdaafd66f81fa539eb4542fa6_2_200x200.jpeg\" alt=\"HACKATHON (1)\" data-base62-sha1=\"foJUq63J4smertoY4rrpyYMWzCS\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex022/uploads/ros/optimized/3X/6/b/6bec8e8c992ff72cdaafd66f81fa539eb4542fa6_2_200x200.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex022/uploads/ros/optimized/3X/6/b/6bec8e8c992ff72cdaafd66f81fa539eb4542fa6_2_300x300.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/flex022/uploads/ros/optimized/3X/6/b/6bec8e8c992ff72cdaafd66f81fa539eb4542fa6_2_400x400.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"51644C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eHACKATHON (1)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1200×1200 377 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re down to the wire on regular price ROSCon Global tickets! \u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/noto/police_car_light.png?v=15\" title=\":police_car_light:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":police_car_light:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe last day to purchase regular price tickets is Monday, August 24th.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/noto/police_car_light.png?v=15\" title=\":police_car_light:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":police_car_light:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Next week we’re planning to release registration information for after parties, hackathons, tours, receptions, and after hours events at ROSCon.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"d-image-grid\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e